Close each file in tac.
tac never closed the files it read. tac is a NOEXEC applet, and with
enough operands it ran out of streams and failed to open the rest, as
with about 500 files on Windows. Close every file but stdin after
reading it.

---
 coreutils/tac.c |    1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/coreutils/tac.c
+++ b/coreutils/tac.c
@@ -101,6 +101,7 @@
 			bb_simple_perror_msg(*name);
 			retval = EXIT_FAILURE;
 		}
+		fclose_if_not_stdin(f);
 	} while (name != argv);
 
 	while (list) {
